[Music]  I'm Keith Olbermann and this is the  resistance I called for a federal grand  jury to be impaneled to determine if  crimes have been committed by the Trump  presidential campaign the Trump  presidential transition team and now the  Trump presidential administration  involving Russian attempts to influence  American democracy specifically the  presidential election of 2016 I call for  that grand jury to look specifically to  the actions of Trump attorney Michael  Cohen Trump business associate Felix  Sater Trump's former campaign manager  Paul Manafort and former national  security adviser Michael Flynn  specifically in regards to contacts with  agents of the Russian government in 2016  and 2017 I call on that grand jury to  hear evidence as to whether or not  indictment should be returned against  White House officials chief of staff  Reince Priebus or press secretary Sean  Spicer or others I call on that grand  jury to ascertain specifically whether  Priebus or others violating the 2009  Department of Justice procedure memo  requiring that White House contact with  the FBI about investigations be made  only by the president vice president  White House Counsel or principal deputy  white House Counsel is evidence of  prohibited criminal behavior such as  aiding and abetting conspiracy or  misprision of a felony I call on that  grand jury to determine whether  indictments should be returned against  house permanent Select Committee on  Intelligence Chairman Devin newness  Senate Select Committee on Intelligence  Chairman Richard Burr and officials at  the FBI and CIA I call on that grand  jury to ascertain specifically whether  newness and burr and the others  mishandled classified information about  investigations by the intelligence  services of the Trump Russian connection  when newness and burr had conversations  with reporters on behalf of the White  House I urge that grand jury to  carefully review the actions already  publicly acknowledged or reported such  as the contact between general Flynn and  the Russian ambassador Sergei kis lack  such as the meeting between ambassador  kis lyac and the president's son-in-law  such as the involvement of trump  attorney cohen and the four or five  different stories about that involvement  mr. cohen has told in  delivering a plan to general Flynn to  destabilize the government of Ukraine  such as the efforts by mr. Priebus to  influence FBI deputy director Andrew  McCabe and FBI director James Comey to  quote knock down  unquote the Trump Russia story by leaks  or announcements to the media I urge  that grand jury to ascertain if these  confessed actions already constitute  evidence of illegal actions by the Trump  campaign Trump transition team and Trump  administration and representatives of  the Russian government possibly rising  to the level of misprision conspiracy or  espionage and additionally to ascertain  if they already constitute an  overarching attempt to cover up these  actions and to obstruct justice  Trump's alleged involvement with Russia  obscures perhaps dictates every other  aspect of this existentially dangerous  presidency we have to have answers the  answer we should have gotten from Trump  and his gang was simple it should have  been we have done nothing wrong we will  give the FBI full licence to interview  anybody and read anything we have the  answer we have gotten from them was  instead Trump telling us he quote hasn't  called Russia in 10 years and to get on  with our lives and branding as sore  losers those who believe he is either a  Russian operative or has been  compromised by Russian intelligence and  by declaring war on the FBI and on news  organizations who publish stories about  this topic using leaks from anonymous  sources while we now have mr. Priebus  trying to get the FBI and other  intelligence community figures and  elected officials like congressman  newness and Senator Burke to act as  leakers to news organizations to get the  news organizations to publish favorable  stories about this topic the answer we  should have gotten from newness in his  role as chairman of the House  Intelligence Committee with access to  classified intelligence and burr in his  role as chairman of the Senate  Intelligence Committee with access to  classified intelligence was simple we  will immediately begin open and full  investigations preferably a select joint  committee to determine to what degree  Donald Trump knew of or Cole  with the Russian government to influence  the last presidential election the  answer that we instead have gotten from  mr. newness was that there is no  evidence of Russian contacts but quote  major crimes were committed by those who  leaked about Russian contacts which is  an impossibility if there were no  contacts the answer that we have instead  gotten from mr. newness and mr. burr  constitutes the two of them violating  their oaths of office and compromising  their personal ethics and the codes of  honor required of every public service  in this nation and completely  compromising any congressional  investigation they began to actively  serve as press agents to try to  influence media coverage in order to  suppress investigation and to suppress  truth and to suppress our ability to  know if our foreign policy if our  domestic policy in our school policy of  our self-defense policy if our  government is being run by Americans or  is being run by Russians we have to have  answers in short  senator Burr representative newness mr.  Priebus mr. manapouri director Pompeo  director Comey director McCain mr. Cohen  mr. Seder general Flynn mr. Kushner mr.  Trump we need to know from you if we are  still Americans or if we are now merely  living in a colony of Russia tell it to  the grand jury resist peace

